{
  "version": 3,
  "datasetVersion": "2026-10-28.agent-eval.v3",
  "notes": "Versioned business-evaluation cases. tier=representative are core flows expected to pass; tier=challenge probe refusal, cancellation, invalid params, ownership, tool failure and lost-response edges. heldOut=true cases are reserved for regression hold-out and excluded from tuning. The fixture block declares synthetic per-user initial state, expected end state, forbidden side effects and cleanup for the end-to-end driver; the scorer judges the recorded trace only.",
  "cases": [
    {
